plain SELECT: DEFAULT conflicts with a workers num that wants a distributed plan
UNION (clause on the last arm): same conflict
EXPLAIN PIPELINE of that SELECT: same conflict
EXPLAIN ANALYZE of that SELECT: same conflict
a session-level workers num also conflicts with an in-query DEFAULT
without a workers num or worker cluster, an in-query DEFAULT is just an explicit 0, no error
false
a bare SET make_distributed_plan = DEFAULT still clears it (not an explicit 0), unlike an in-query SETTINGS clause
true
